# Azure AI Speech — Uzbek neural voices (uz-UZ-MadinaNeural / uz-UZ-SardorNeural).
# Create a "Speech" resource at https://portal.azure.com, then copy "KEY 1" and "Location/Region".
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=your-azure-speech-key
AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=westeurope

# Optional: path to an existing Chrome/Chromium for rendering (only needed when
# Remotion cannot download its own browser).
# REMOTION_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE=/path/to/chrome-headless-shell
